    "promptTemplate": "按以下规则判断每个样本是否有效。只输出一个 JSON 对象，validIds 为有效样本的两位编号数组，按编号升序排列。不要解释。\n\n规则：\n生成 JSON Schema 2020-12：顶层数组，长度 2 至 4，所有数组元素按完整 JSON 值去重。每个元素只能有必需的 kind、name；kind 是 start/stop，name 是非空字符串。整个数组恰有一个 kind=start 的元素。name 不要求在不同元素间唯一，不能额外限制。 可以自由选择等价的标准 Schema 写法；只允许本地引用，不允许外部引用；Schema 嵌套深度不超过 64。使用这些有界题目时验证器会限制编译/验证资源。\n\n样本：\n01: [{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":\"A\"},{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"B\"}]\n02: [{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"A\"},{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":\"B\"},{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"C\"}]\n03: null\n04: {}\n05: []\n06: [{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":\"A\"}]\n07: [{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":\"A\"},{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":\"A\"}]\n08: [{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":\"A\"},{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":\"B\"}]\n09: [{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"A\"},{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"B\"}]\n10: [{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":\"\"},{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"B\"}]\n11: [{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":\"A\",\"extra\":1},{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"B\"}]\n12: [{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":1},{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"B\"}]\n13: [{\"kind\":\"start\",\"name\":\"A\"},{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"B\"},{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"C\"},{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"D\"},{\"kind\":\"stop\",\"name\":\"E\"}]\n\n输出 Schema：{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"validIds\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"pattern\":\"^[0-9]{2}$\"},\"uniqueItems\":true}},\"required\":[\"validIds\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}",
    "requirements": {
      "format": "json",
      "dialect": "2020-12",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "validIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[0-9]{2}$"
            },
            "uniqueItems": true
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "validIds"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "formatAssertions": true,
      "assertions": [
        {
          "pointer": "/validIds",
          "expected": [
            "01",
            "02"
          ],
          "description": "All finite examples classified exactly"
        }
      ],
